{"4738880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Last Comfort", "steam_appid": 4738880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Comfort is a Metroidvania set within a child's subconscious mind. You play as Tedd, his favorite teddy bear, set on a mission to save the boy from a terminal illness. You must traverse through the child's memories, dreams, and nightmares and save him from the sickness.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/1b682c3d69a47b965e4b36458244f911.poster.avif?t=1787653524\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/1b682c3d69a47b965e4b36458244f911.webm?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/1b682c3d69a47b965e4b36458244f911.mp4?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world in the boy's mind is vast, filled with enemies and obstacles. You have to fight through many enemies and bosses that each have different attack sequences, and you have to learn their patterns, know how to parry/block, stun them, and know when to strike!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/7afa9ad2c1f79a88cca4f930a97de9e0.poster.avif?t=1787653524\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/7afa9ad2c1f79a88cca4f930a97de9e0.webm?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/7afa9ad2c1f79a88cca4f930a97de9e0.mp4?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the block system to knock enemies off balance, use fade-away slashes to control the gap, and parry at the exact second an enemy strikes to unleash a devastating counter-attack.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/620d6ccf88e4d1ad58d34f7c66843045.poster.avif?t=1787653524\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/620d6ccf88e4d1ad58d34f7c66843045.webm?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/620d6ccf88e4d1ad58d34f7c66843045.mp4?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is full of danger in this decaying mind, but some places are still safe and clean from the sickness. This is where you get a breather before you continue on ahead in search of the sickness. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/3df36a20deb31fe8cc68e798eefc7df6.poster.avif?t=1787653524\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/3df36a20deb31fe8cc68e798eefc7df6.webm?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/3df36a20deb31fe8cc68e798eefc7df6.mp4?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You aren't forced into one specific way to fight. Throughout the world, you will find unique bracelets with different abilities and skills to help you build the way you like to play. Find keys to unlock more slots to equip more bracelets.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/28babb212458f9a0e56d60ce98de8899.poster.avif?t=1787653524\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/28babb212458f9a0e56d60ce98de8899.webm?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/28babb212458f9a0e56d60ce98de8899.mp4?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected Exploration: Find your own path through a non linear map, from toxic bogs to deep, dark caves.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization: Tailor your combat approach with unique Bracelets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactile Progression: Find Memory stones statues to acquire powerful new skills that fundamentally change your movement and combat potential.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vital Rewards: Defeat overwhelming bosses to earn coins for the shop and collect crucial Star Shards to keep yourself healed during difficult fights.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings: The child's ultimate fate rests on the secrets you uncover and the choices you make in the dark.</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Comfort is a Metroidvania set within a child's subconscious mind. You play as Tedd, his favorite teddy bear, set on a mission to save the boy from a terminal illness. You must traverse through the child's memories, dreams, and nightmares and save him from the sickness.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline p