eam/apps/4738880/extras/620d6ccf88e4d1ad58d34f7c66843045.webm?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/620d6ccf88e4d1ad58d34f7c66843045.mp4?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is full of danger in this decaying mind, but some places are still safe and clean from the sickness. This is where you get a breather before you continue on ahead in search of the sickness. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/3df36a20deb31fe8cc68e798eefc7df6.poster.avif?t=1787653524\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/3df36a20deb31fe8cc68e798eefc7df6.webm?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/3df36a20deb31fe8cc68e798eefc7df6.mp4?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You aren't forced into one specific way to fight. Throughout the world, you will find unique bracelets with different abilities and skills to help you build the way you like to play. Find keys to unlock more slots to equip more bracelets.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/28babb212458f9a0e56d60ce98de8899.poster.avif?t=1787653524\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/28babb212458f9a0e56d60ce98de8899.webm?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/extras/28babb212458f9a0e56d60ce98de8899.mp4?t=1787653524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected Exploration: Find your own path through a non linear map, from toxic bogs to deep, dark caves.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization: Tailor your combat approach with unique Bracelets.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactile Progression: Find Memory stones statues to acquire powerful new skills that fundamentally change your movement and combat potential.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vital Rewards: Defeat overwhelming bosses to earn coins for the shop and collect crucial Star Shards to keep yourself healed during difficult fights.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings: The child's ultimate fate rests on the secrets you uncover and the choices you make in the dark.</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The Last Comfort is a Metroidvania set within a child's subconscious mind. You must traverse through the child's memories, dreams, and nightmares as Tedd, his favorite toy, find the sickness, and save the child from a terminal nightmare.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Maltese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/5967ef035f8c419f60e1d7afcf93a8c1254e8ff6/header.jpg?t=1787653524", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/56aa4515b43934f81d948acdadf54264a2b34168/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787653524", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4738880/56aa4515b43934f81d948acdadf54264a2b34168/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787653524", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "